# FIX-02: Missing SoftwareApplication JSON-LD Schema Markup

- **Category:** Structured Data (AEO)
- **Target Page:** https://incubrix.com/ (Homepage)
- **Priority:** P0 - Critical
- **Problem Identified:** Homepage has 0 structured schema markup. Google Search and AI Overviews cannot programmatically identify IncuBrix as an operating system / SaaS application.
- **Evidence from Live Audit:** grep 'application/ld+json' incubrix_home.html yields 0 occurrences.
- **Validation Benchmark:** Google Rich Results Test & Schema.org Validator (100% Valid, 0 Errors, 0 Warnings)

